@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@token = {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### Login - replace with the credentials in your local environment
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "ChangeMe123!"
}

### Current user
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Organisation chart (flat, in order)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/units
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List documents the user may read (filters: q, state, document_type, unit_id, date_from, date_to, sort, desc, limit, offset)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/documents?q=quyet%20dinh&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Upload one or more files (each succeeds or fails on its own)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----qk3

------qk3
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="declared_secret"

false
------qk3
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="van-ban.docx"
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document

< ./van-ban.docx
------qk3--

### One document with its processing steps
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/documents/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Document text, paragraph by paragraph
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/documents/1/content
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Correct extracted metadata by hand (uploader or admin)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/documents/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "V/v ...", "issued_date": "2026-05-04" }

### Process again
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/documents/1/reprocess
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete (file, index entries and record)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/documents/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---- Admin ----

### Accounts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create account
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "congbinh01", "password": "Matkhau-thu-nghiem-1", "full_name": "Cán bộ Công binh", "unit_id": "btm.cong_binh", "role": "staff" }

### All settings sections (secrets appear only as {"set": true/false})
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Try a connection without saving (omitted secrets use the saved ones)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/settings/embedding/test
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "values": { "provider": "openai", "base_url": "http://10.0.0.5:8000/v1", "model": "my-embedder", "dim": 1024 } }

### Save a section (an endpoint outside the private network needs confirm_hosts)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/settings/embedding
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "values": { "provider": "openai", "base_url": "http://10.0.0.5:8000/v1", "model": "my-embedder", "dim": 1024 }, "confirm_hosts": [] }

### Index every document again (after changing the embedding model)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/reindex
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Audit trail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/audit-logs?limit=50&action=settings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---- Assistant (see CHAT_API.md for the event shapes) ----

### Start a conversation
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Ask (server-sent events: session, step, canvas, answer, error, done). Put the id returned above in the path.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/sessions/{{sessionId}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "Kế hoạch tập huấn Công binh năm 2026 tổ chức khi nào?", "canvas": false, "attachment_ids": [] }

### Stop the answer in progress
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/sessions/{{sessionId}}/stop
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Attach a file to the conversation
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/sessions/{{sessionId}}/attachments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=x

--x
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="ke-hoach.docx"
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document

< ./ke-hoach.docx
--x--

### The draft (canvas) of the conversation
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/sessions/{{sessionId}}/draft
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Check the draft against Thông tư 68
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/sessions/{{sessionId}}/draft/check
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
